{"parse": {"title": "暗色带编织-02", "pageid": 97163, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E8%89%B2%E5%B8%A6%E7%BC%96%E7%BB%87-01\" title=\"暗色带编织-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">暗色带编织-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E8%89%B2%E5%B8%A6%E7%BC%96%E7%BB%87-03\" title=\"暗色带编织-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">暗色带编织</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"\"></span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> </div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅰ：</div><div>有一天，我在一篇文章里读到了一个说法——说是你们智利人不喜欢巴洛克文学，大概是因为聒噪。你们天性沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅱ：</div><div>噢？看来你们阿根廷人是相当地喜欢了？照我看，阿根廷人可是相当的吵闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅰ：</div><div>你这家伙，仗着理想家先生缺席，就想将沙龙变成批评辩论赛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅱ：</div><div>明明是你先……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>够了！有那贫嘴的功夫，不如把作品贴出来看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>依我看，你们只是相较文体更热衷于韵律，我们丰富的拉丁美洲语言天生就具备丰富、善变与艺术性，就像巴洛克文学一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惯于沉默的男人为辩论浇了一桶冰块，令狱友们进入了难能可贵的冷静期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>哈哈！话说回来，我还挺真切地怀念他们的。自打那些疯疯癫癫的朋友们离开了诗社，咱们在意识流创作的探索上就少了很多乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>我倒是乐于讨论关于意识流创作中的“美学价值”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着新话题浮出水面，狱友们的音量又逐渐高昂了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>这是一场别开生面的文学沙龙，其中充满了情绪化、片面化的论调。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>但我并不抵触这里的一切。相反，这些囚犯们给我一种不可思议的感觉。他们之中没有任何一个人将自己视作丧失自由的囚徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>这些热衷于文学的人们在一座废弃的监狱中相遇，共同建造了一座理想的国度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>一切就像一场约定。但从现实来讲，这里分明是一座隶属于政府的监狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-522211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-522211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-522211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>诸位——请安静一下！我有一件事情需要宣布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陌生的女声打断了纪实作家心中打字机的咔咔作响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未曾谋面的女作家从另一端的黑暗中走上了沙龙的中央，停驻于为发言者置备的白板与讲桌前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>由于私事，理想家先生将缺席本次沙龙。他在墙角的石头下压了一封信件，嘱托本人为本次文学沙龙的代言人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>在本期沙龙上，我将为大家公布我们之后的研究主题——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>“社会现实关注与自我存在探寻的关系性”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>座下一片哗然——显然，参与者们听到了一个与预期相悖的说法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扬了扬手中的信件，做了一个噤声的手势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>在场的各位同好们，未来的重要作家们……自十九世纪末以来，那些曾经震慑文学界的名字，现在也不过逐渐沦为了谈资。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>朋友们，文学已经沦为了边缘的艺术。人们走进剧院、电影院和艺术馆，欣赏油画、为雕塑驻足，却很少有人能完整地读完一本著作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>当家庭遭分崩离析，当祖国被暴政蹂躏，我们美洲诗社究竟能做到什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>我们的武器就是小说！它应当毫不含糊地成为重大的、严肃的，一类对社会进步直接而起作用的工具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>底下的观众陷入了短暂的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>你可以试着写出一部属于拉丁美洲的《战争与和平》。<br />而我们则继续原来的沙龙主题——这并不矛盾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>……为了理想家先生先前所说的主题，我已经准备了足足一个月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>如果你执意要修改理想家先生的论题，那我就先行离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>奥克塔维奥小姐……原谅我的打断，但这跟我们事先约定好的主题不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>你所说的一切……我们是做不到那种事的！我们连自己的生活都没搞明白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>奥克塔维奥，这个议题有点意思。<br />也许我们可以就这个主题聊点儿什么——但不会是现在。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-519801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡利奥：</div><div>另外，希望你别忘了自己的遭遇——正是因为你到处宣传“把小说当成武器”，才会被扔进这种地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅰ：</div><div>正如胡利奥所说——要不是拜你的富商老爹所赐，你这会儿应该在处刑台上，而不是在这里高谈阔论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻言，支持奥克塔维奥的囚犯出言反驳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>你们根本没弄懂奥克塔维奥小姐的意思！伟大的作家就应当像个偏执的掘墓人一样，在时代的坟茔中挖出社会现实主义的腐肉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-523101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅲ：</div><div>只有这个庞大的社会熔炉，才有资格成为我们文学上的宿主！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>加西亚先生略显抵触，胡利奥先生严厉提醒，而罗贝托小姐则注重劝解。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>之后，更多的人参与了辩论，一些为奥克塔维奥小姐说话的声音逐渐出现了。<br />诗社的成员们在无形中分为了两派。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>那时，我意识到自己需要做些什么，来中止这场彻底误入歧途的文学沙龙。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>请允许我自我介绍，我是来自圣保罗的德洛丝。我的笔名是“兀尔德”，我也是一名作家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>兀尔德……？我好像在哪儿看到过这个名字……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>等等，您是给UTTU杂志投稿的那个“兀尔德”吗？天呐，我没想到今天竟然会迎来一位这样的贵客！我很喜欢您投稿的那篇《圣保罗锌皮兵》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>是的……此次前来拜访科马拉监狱，也是取材的重要部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>那，请问兀尔德女士，您又是如何看待我们今天的沙龙主题呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>难题出现了，涉及到认知偏好、创作立场与政治倾向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天秤的两端向来难以平衡。何况，此类问题最重要的从来都不是答案本身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>就我个人的了解来说，文学一直处于世界的边缘地带。被漠视、被排外、被误解。就像……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-518510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>是的，就像乌斯怀亚一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在座的各位反应不一。有的陷入沉思，有的赞许点头，有的面带疑惑。<br />听众们并未意识到话题的转变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>对于大多数人来说，这座位于世界尽头的监狱太过遥远、太过寒冷，甚至可以说是太过绝望。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-518511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div><i>当一名囚犯刚被送到这里来的时候，我们能够想象：他首先感受到的是一滩死水，一滩平静的绝望。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生抓住了这个稍纵即逝的机会，试图让文学沙龙从立场争斗的泥沼中重回正轨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些望着河流、小船与散尾葵敲下打字机的时日浮现于眼前，令医生的话语顺畅了起来——文字是诚实的，关于文字的一切并不是谎言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>我来到此地，正是为我的下一部作品取材。我会如实地记录我在此处所经历、所聆听到的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>那么，兀尔德女士，请问您打算写一部什么样的作品呢？它是一部纪实文学吗？它的主题和科马拉监狱有关吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>它的主题是——“命运”。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "暗色带编织-02"}}